				5
			],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "9d1c3a62a64ff5488a005170657814f2c3306ad5"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-11T22:36:22Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠃⠀⠀",
				26,
				12
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize core submodules with fixes and dependency updates\n\nUpdate multiple submodules to bring in critical bug fixes, documentation improvements, and dependency updates across the Land editor stack.\n\n**Mountain** receives a significant batch of error handling and robustness fixes:\n- Add missing doc-comment periods and restructure rustdoc (`//!` blocks) across Error, Library, Binary, Environment, and all Provider modules — move TODO notes out of public-facing docs into inline `// TODO:` comments\n- Expand `mmap` → `MemoryMap` and `TTL` → `TimeToLive` abbreviations per project no-abbreviations rule\n- Fix TreeView unregister/dispose to actually call provider and emit `TreeViewDispose` event\n- Replace hardcoded fallback URIs in `$resolveCustomEditor` and document save with proper error returns\n- Add empty-path guards and `StripFileUriScheme` to FileSystem.Stat, ReadDirectory, and legacy alias routes\n- Wire oneshot reply channels for ShowQuickPick, ShowInputBox, ShowOpenDialog, ShowSaveDialog\n- Propagate Err from `workspace.applyEdit` instead of synthetic `true`\n- Wrap git subprocess with 30s timeout to prevent indefinite hangs\n- Release `scanned_extensions` lock before aggregation loop in Languages.GetAll\n- Replace hardcoded ProviderType::Hover with per-type match arms for language feature registrations\n- Add error logging parity to config.update side effects and unify config update arms behind shared helper\n- Use bracket notation (`process.env[\"VAR\"]`) for env access in bootstrap-fork.js\n\n**Cocoon** bumps protobufjs from 8.0.3 to 8.2.0 and pnpm/action-setup from 6.0.5 to 6.0.6.\n\n**Common**, **Echo** update @cloudflare/workers-types from 4.20260508.1 to 4.20260510.1.\n\n**Grove** bumps wasmparser (0.247→0.248), opentelemetry-otlp (0.31→0.32), and opentelemetry-semantic-conventions (0.31→0.32).\n\n**Worker** compiles ESBuild configuration to minified output with source maps.\n\n**Rest** reformats bin/Rest.js with single quotes and consistent indentation.\n\n**Wind** bumps pnpm/action-setup from 6.0.5 to 6.0.7.",
			"SHA": "50c8c8f6597c4ad1250991775bda28ee10803ae1"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-09T17:54:05Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				26,
				1
			],
			"Message": "build(Sky): Configure TypeScript lib and module resolution settings\n\nUpdate `tsconfig.json` and `jsconfig.json` in the Sky editor UI component layer to explicitly define the compilation environment. Add `ESNext`, `DOM`, and `DOM.Iterable` to the `lib` array to ensure proper type checking for modern browser APIs used in the Astro/React frontend. Set `ignoreDeprecations` to \"6.0\" to align with the current TypeScript target. Reorder `extends` to the bottom of `tsconfig.json` to allow local `compilerOptions` like `moduleResolution: \"Bundler\"` and `module: \"esnext\"` to take precedence over the base `@playform/build` configuration.\n\nThis ensures consistent type resolution across the Sky component tree and prevents implicit `any` errors related to missing DOM definitions.",
			"SHA": "610c8ac2b55bbace3819ecd37a801ec1366ef754"
		}
	],
